{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering through the grim Gerryda Ravine you stumble upon a Teahouse. The local Matron, in her mercy, suggests that you stay for a while. Fend off uninvited Visitors , cook Tea, craft Totems, bake Cookies, brew Alcohol, and welcome invited Visitors. Explore the environment and make deals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget, though, that every deal comes with a trade-off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<br>&gt; Playtime: ~15-60min per Playthrough<br>&gt; three different Weapons<br>&gt; small world<br>&gt; improve your abilities by investing resources while taking trade-offs into account<br>&gt; different choices and outcomes<br>&gt; optional Permadeath<br>&gt; short, obscure Text</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951600?t=1759910007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951600/8df8a7a1d1d9d140b6137a6ce6b51494e26697ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759910007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951600/d8bee330cc0c224439303986fdbd239dff593e33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759910007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951600/d8bee330cc0c224439303986fdbd239dff593e33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759910007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Neon Tea is a Lovecraft-inspired game where grotesque creatures must be destroyed. These depictions are created using pixel art, yet a dark, oppressive atmosphere prevails, brought to life primarily through the player's imagination."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While wandering through the grim Gerryda Ravine you stumble upon a Teahouse. The local Matron, i